# W5s, c (a moderator, k5): takes the gate while a's Private instance runs in stag0101; its gate form lists a's row (the staff
# bypass), the cursor on New instance; autochoice first chooses a's row: an audited staff join.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@150
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log c in stag0101
idle until present=2,sealed>=300 fail frames>=6000
log c joined a as staff
idle until frames>=900
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
